{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“他想把话说妥当些”把 B1 中反复讲述、补充细节的比喻，以及 B2 中想把情意说出口的比喻，具体化成了他现实中斟酌措辞、准备开口的打算；其余关于心意、迟疑和害怕失去亲近的内容基本有前文依据。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S03-1 已确立心意仍在、惦记说清又怕改变相处，直接支撑本条心意压不下去、想表达又迟疑的状态。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-1 已明确他怕说清心意改变相处、想留住亲近且意识到时间流逝，本条仍在受这些原因推动。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"不看珠子也能读出他心意难以压下、想表达又怕改变关系，并因时间流逝而担心失去眼下的亲近。\"\n  ,\n  \"progress\": \"是\",\n  \"progress_why\": \"“心意压不下去”承接 S03-1 中仍在涌动的心意，将此前的持续状态推进为更难压住的状态，而不只是重复害怕失去亲近的背景理由。\"\n  ,\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S04-1\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"“免得说出口就改了相处”不够自然，宜改为“怕说出口会改变两人的相处”；后半关于时间流逝和怕失去亲近虽重复了 S02-1 的背景，但也服务于本段的紧迫感，不算明显的无效堆叠。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a88c2f86-188f-42e4-8b44-f60ab36c85fd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T053206907150Z", "elapsed_seconds": 82.828, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T05:33:29.740992+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cf677fc6a8971676762aed34af8262bf35549dcd722aa0a21f56f6a09f24d888", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256